{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6391","title":"POCO Unveils POCO C95 Pro: Built for Long-Lasting Power and Immersive Entertainment","desc":"POCO, a leading brand among technology enthusiasts, today introduced POCO C95 Pro, an entertainment pioneer designed to deliver longer-lasting battery life and immersive viewing for a smooth everyday experience.","view_cnt":"1312","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1790582290","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/934_operatorx_operatorx_opx/28/09/2026/be60404146a659bd10b2c733c117a6ac.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, China, October 1, 2026 \u003c/strong\u003e– POCO, a leading brand among technology enthusiasts, today introduced POCO C95 Pro, an entertainment pioneer designed to deliver longer-lasting battery life and immersive viewing for a smooth everyday experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMassive Battery with 45W Turbo Charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C95 Pro delivers impressive battery performance with a massive 7,500mAh (typ) battery, delivering over 2 days of use¹ for reliable performance whether you're working, streaming, or on the move. It also supports up to 91 hours of music playback,² allowing users to enjoy extended entertainment and productivity without constantly worrying about running low on power.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/615_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/09/2026/97b6d56e8e4df68dbfbe4a628a4bcb27.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWhen it is time to recharge, 45W turbo charging helps get the device back up and running quickly. Just 35 minutes of charging can provide all-day power,² helping minimize downtime. Adding practical versatility, POCO C95 Pro also supports reverse charging, allowing users to share power with other compatible accessories when needed.³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDurability meets longevity with the built-in long-life battery technology. Even after 1,000 charge cycles, the battery retains up to 80% of its original capacity, ensuring consistent performance over years of use.⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Viewing with Smooth 120Hz\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C95 Pro features an immersive 6.9-inch display that gives video, social content, browsing and gaming more room to shine. A refresh rate of up to 120Hz keeps scrolling smooth and motion fluid across supported apps, bringing a responsive feel to frequent interactions.⁵ Its punch-hole design minimizes visual interruption and gives content more room to take center stage. To support comfortable viewing throughout the day, POCO C95 Pro features triple TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications, allowing users to enjoy their favorite content with enhanced visual comfort for longer periods.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/932_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/09/2026/d15f81e50ab4226695d0d896b08fd023.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile phone is placed flat on a smooth surface, with blue and green patterns displayed on the screen. The edges of the phone are deep blue, presenting a clean and modern design overall.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrend-Forward Design with Refined Details\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C95 Pro comes in three distinctive colorways inspired by nature and timeless design. Blue draws on the depth and calm of the sky, Green takes inspiration from the resilience and vitality of the oak, while Black offers a timeless and understated finish. The Green variant further features a PU finish, adding a warmer texture and more tactile character. Design details carry that sense of refinement through the rest of the device. A metal deco creates a distinctive focal point on the rear, while the large rounded-radius corners blend smoothly into the frame, delivering visually balanced, symmetrical bezels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBuilt to withstand everyday challenges, POCO C95 Pro features IP64 dust and water resistance, adding reassurance against dust and splashes in common situations.⁶ Corning® Gorilla® Glass 7i further enhances display durability, helping protect against scratches and drops during daily use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth Everyday Experience with Reliable Performance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePowered by MediaTek Helio G91-Ultra, POCO C95 Pro provides a dependable foundation for entertainment, communication and multitasking. Support for up to 16GB RAM with Memory extension helps keep app switching responsive and makes moving between frequently used tasks feel smoother.⁷ A 50MP AI dual camera system helps capture vivid moments with clarity, while the 8MP front camera supports selfies and video calls. Together, POCO C95 Pro makes it easy to capture and share moments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/975_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/09/2026/d8a67f4b35597083ce55b259b856bdb7.png\" alt=\"The image showcases a MediaTek Helio G91 Ultra chip, surrounded by flowing golden light and an electronic circuit background, conveying a sense of speed and technology.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C95 Pro will be available in three colors: Blue, Black, and Green.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 6GB + 128GB and 8GB + 256GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by country/region, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ The data is based on test results from Xiaomi Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting moderate daily use (including typical smartphone activities such as home screen use, music playback, social media, email, maps, video streaming, standby, etc.). Actual results may vary due to differences in the testing environment, software version, network conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ Supports up to 22.5W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through Xiaomi Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ Data refers to the battery remaining at 80% or more capacity after 1000 battery life cycles. Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 120Hz for supported apps.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ The device has been tested in a controlled environment and certified to be resistant to splash and dust in specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP64 under IEC 60529: 1989+A1:1999+A2:2013. Splash-proof, waterproof and dustproof features may be degraded due to daily use loss. Do not charge your smartphone in a humid condition. The life scene is different from the experimental environment. Do not immerse your smartphone in water completely or expose it to solutions such as seawater and chlorinated water or liquids such as drinks during daily use. Your warranty does not cover the damage caused by man-made immersion of your device in liquid.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ 16GB RAM with Memory extension is based on 8GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy — \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" — drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making, accelerates the company’s evolution, and refreshes the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"365","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1790845219"},"common":null}